tion><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>申请条件</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>拥护中国共产党的领导、愿为祖国建设服务、品德良好、遵纪守法的中国公民，且满足以下条件：</span></p><p><span>1. 已在本科院校获得推荐免试资格的优秀应届本科毕业生</span><span>（2027年毕业）</span><span>。</span></p><p><span>2.本科专业为机械、电子信息、半导体材料、工艺、器件、设备等相关的领域；</span></p><p><span>3. 身心健康，符合国家和我校规定的体检要求。</span></p><p><span>4. 科学研究兴趣浓厚，有较好的科研潜质、专业能力和较强的创新意识。</span></p><p><span>5. 诚实守信，学风端正，无任何违法违纪受处分记录。</span></p><p><span>6. 成绩优秀，英语水平良好。</span></p><p><span>7. 教育部规定的其他条件要求。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>招生专业</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>招生专业：学院按照大类开展招生，招生专业包括：</span><span><br/></span></p><p><span>0854电子信息</span><span><br/></span></p><p><span>0855机械</span><span><br/></span></p><p><span>0856材料与化工</span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>申请方式</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span>1.</span><span>推免预报名时间：即日起-8月31日18：00</span></span><span><span>。</span><span>本次报名时限如有调整，以官方后续发布的最新通知为准。</span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>2.网上报名：</span><span>南方科技大学研究生招生服务系统（https://yzbm.sustech.edu.cn/，推荐使用chrome、360浏览器），点击“全国优秀大学生推免生预报名”，选择“国家卓越工程师学院”进行在线报名。申请者需在系统注册登录，并按照要求填写真实信息。</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>申请材料</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>申请者需在网上报名系统注册登录，并按照要求提供本人各项真实信息并上传以下证明材料：</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>（1）身份证正反面扫描件或照片；</span></p><p><span>（2）学生证扫描件或照片；</span></p><p><span>（3）包含所修全部课程的正式成绩单（院系或教务处加盖公章）；成绩单上标注所在专业的成绩排名；</span></p><p><span>（4）个人陈述（</span><span>介绍学术背景、曾经做过的研究工作、以及将来攻读研究生阶段的学习和研究计划、研究生毕业后的就业目标等，1000字以内。</span><span>）；</span></p><p><span>（5</span><span>）</span><span><span>其他体现个人学术水平、综合能力的证明材料（包括但不限于英语水平证书、论文首页及奖状证书等），扫描为一个PDF文件后上传至系统。</span></span><span>）；</span></p><p><span>（6）申请推免直博研究生的同学，必须提交专家推荐信2封，申请推免硕士研究生同学可自愿提交</span></p><p><span>（7）推免预报名申请表（签字版）。</span></p><p><span>（8）简历。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>请于报名后积极联系我院导师，可招生导师列表详见官网：</span></p><p><span>https://ngce.sustech.edu.cn/#/tutor?alias=f0a303ea-9f2a-4cee-8454-f966c9ba6896</span></p></section><section><sect